Figure 3.3 shows the layout of the STAR detector along with its various subsystems. The STAR magnet system is a room temperature solenoidal magnet which was designed in cylindrical shape with a length of 6.85 m and has inner as well as outer diameter of 5.27 m and 7.32 m, respectively. It provides a uniform magnetic field which acts parallels to the beam direction (\(z\) direction) with a maximum value 0.5 T.

